Use of SSAU in operational, governance, infrastructure, AI, or safety-critical contexts is undertaken entirely at the user’s own responsibility.

SSAU provides structural admissibility discipline and deterministic replay guarantees under declared scope.

It does not provide operational authority, certification, or safety guarantees.


